Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 10:33:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] test(rfork): cover planner contract and clarify guide

Add planner lifecycle and memory-registration rollback tests. Correct RFork bypass conditions, conditional fallback cleanup, required planner headers, loading order and logging guidance in the English guide and Chinese translation. Preserve the existing main and draft seed behavior.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 99e72b88622ada5a500c9cb11db59c96c22e24bf)
Signed-off-by: AbyssSkb <abyssskb@outlook.com>
